{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thousands of years ago, humanity built colossal war machines to stop the apocalypse. Now they just use them for dance battles.  <br> <br>In this demo, you'll take your first steps into the world of Steel Century Groove, meet the cast of charming characters, and get a taste of the unique rhythm combat system. Then you can carry over your save to the full game once it releases.</p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/138c044c07034b31376845c74c584353.poster.avif?t=1754013689\" aria-label=\"Dance Dance Mecha! Challenge other pilots to intense dance-offs on a massive scale. In an animated GIF of gameplay, mechs hit notes on a smooth curving track.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/138c044c07034b31376845c74c584353.webm?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/138c044c07034b31376845c74c584353.mp4?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/dc117a017f63f27fd11bd00e209ac29f.poster.avif?t=1754013689\" aria-label=\"RPG Rhythm Battles. Each mech has a unique kit and special mechanics. Choose the best move for each note to defeat your opponent. There is an animated GIF of an RPG ability bar as the player activates their abilities.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/dc117a017f63f27fd11bd00e209ac29f.webm?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/dc117a017f63f27fd11bd00e209ac29f.mp4?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/12aebaba582ac17fea547a497b75b4ae.poster.avif?t=1754013689\" aria-label=\"A Pilot&#039;s Journey. Collect parts around town, pick a starter mech from the local professor, and challenge your rivals out on the road. In an animated GIF, the player is blocked by a character named Gigi on her hoverbike. She says &amp;quot;Hey, flop!&amp;quot;\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/12aebaba582ac17fea547a497b75b4ae.webm?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/12aebaba582ac17fea547a497b75b4ae.mp4?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/0694a39d0f567e7c4e38b41a6e9acbdf.poster.avif?t=1754013689\" aria-label=\"Turn Up The Volume. Groove to the awesome built-in soundtrack or bring your own MP3s. In an animated GIF, a group of mechs dance in a museum.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/0694a39d0f567e7c4e38b41a6e9acbdf.webm?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/extras/0694a39d0f567e7c4e38b41a6e9acbdf.mp4?t=1754013689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Additional Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Collect and upgrade:</strong> Level up your mechs, equip them with mods, and pair them with backup dancers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique gameplay kits:\u00a0</strong>Each mech has their own set of abilities, mechanics, and resources. Choose from three starter mechs, ranging from a simple mech that gains and spends energy to a more advanced mech that commands an army of drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flexible rhythm combat:\u00a0</strong>Steel Century Groove doesn't demand a specific button press for each note. Instead, pick from your mech's kit of battle abilities. Your strategic choices matter just as much as your timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo options:\u00a0</strong>Start a new game in story mode to get the full experience, or choose demo mode to skip the early story and dive right into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Head start:\u00a0</strong>Transfer your save to the full game when it releases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No playing the metronome:</strong> Challenge yourself against interesting melodies, even when playing with your own music. You\u2019ll never just be endlessly tapping out the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No accessories required:</strong> Built from the start for gamepad or mouse &amp; keyboard.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609300?t=1754013689","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609300?t=1754013689","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/03c1d88f528fbbec688b63a36ba19e0d58e993c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754013689","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/03c1d88f528fbbec688b63a36ba19e0d58e993c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754013689","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Soun