p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique gameplay kits:\u00a0</strong>Each mech has their own set of abilities, mechanics, and resources. Choose from three starter mechs, ranging from a simple mech that gains and spends energy to a more advanced mech that commands an army of drones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flexible rhythm combat:\u00a0</strong>Steel Century Groove doesn't demand a specific button press for each note. Instead, pick from your mech's kit of battle abilities. Your strategic choices matter just as much as your timing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo options:\u00a0</strong>Start a new game in story mode to get the full experience, or choose demo mode to skip the early story and dive right into battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Head start:\u00a0</strong>Transfer your save to the full game when it releases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No playing the metronome:</strong> Challenge yourself against interesting melodies, even when playing with your own music. You\u2019ll never just be endlessly tapping out the beat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No accessories required:</strong> Built from the start for gamepad or mouse &amp; keyboard.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Sloth Gloss Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1858950","name":"Steel Century Groove"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609300/3397397ee75531b27c15cf96d66b3dbac74a03bd/header.jpg?t=1754013689","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161633,"